esigned to work in harmony with all hair types and textures. Whether you have straight, wavy, curly, or coily hair, our nutrient-rich blends provide hydration, strength, and balance without weighing your hair down.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>5. Where are Amun Organics products made?</strong><br>Our products are formulated in Aspen and handcrafted in Canada with the utmost care. We source the highest quality organic ingredients, ensuring that each bottle reflects our commitment to integrity, sustainability, and holistic wellness.</p>"}],
